{"Title":"An Act authorizing Jeffrey H. Jackson to purchase creditable service from the Barnstable County Retirement Board","BillNumber":"H3644","DocketNumber":"HD2496","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"KAD1","Name":"Kip A. Diggs","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T13:31:08.55"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"KAD1","Name":"Kip A. Diggs","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T13:31:08.55"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-27T13:32:55.3633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3644/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Diggs of Barnstable, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3644) of Kip A. Diggs and Steven George Xiarhos (with the approval of the county commissioners) that Jeffrey H. Jackson be authorized to purchase creditable service from the Barnstable County Retirement Board.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding section 3 of chapter 71 of the acts of 1996, or any other general or special law to the contrary, the Barnstable county retirement board shall permit Jeffrey H. Jackson, a member of the Barnstable county retirement system, to purchase creditable service for his military service time pursuant to paragraph (h) of subdivision (1) of section 4 of chapter 32 of the General Laws.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCou